MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c8d1a109e3f4550607082930a1a2b3c4, type: 3}
  m_Name: tutorial_complete_context
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MobileIdleBuilder::MobileIdleBuilder.DialogueSO
  lines:
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: Carbon. The backbone of every living thing, and you forged it from quarks.
      Your factory now earns several times what hydrogen ever did.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 1
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: From here the Foundry is yours. The Research panel climbs on through the
      light elements to Silicon. Past that, the heavier elements and every molecule
      wait for Chemistry.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: 'To open Chemistry, work through the task list that appears at the top
      of the screen. Each stage asks for elements: send them to Maxwell''s Demon
      and they count toward it while still paying entropy. Progress carries over
      when you prestige, so it takes a few runs. Tap the list to see what the current
      stage needs.'
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: 'A tip for your belts: hold any belt to split it, sending its items two
      or three ways. The (i) on the Conveyor Belt card in the Build menu has the
      details.'
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: 'One more tool is coming. After your second prestige the Cyclotron opens
      in the menu: kick a particle around its ring for 30 seconds and everything
      your factory earns is multiplied, up to three times, for a few minutes. It
      recharges, so come back to it. Build, balance, and bank the entropy.'
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
